{"id": "34446", "title": "偷情花后", "author": "橙星", "category": "文学名著", "count": 58, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34446.htm", "intro": "身为第一当铺无情庄的女主人，花无情的格言是：没有什么不可以当的东西，没有什么不还钱的理由。虽然说没有什么不可以当的东西，但当……「男人」？这也是稍微离谱了点！尤其这木板上写着：「典当一人，但要养两人，为期三个月。」实在不划算啊～～可是再不答应这典当条件，她马上就要被盗贼杀死了，看在要他救命的分上，只好答应啰！谁知这男人仗着自己是「高级典当品」，不但侵她的房、佔她的床，还要她伺候这伺候那，当牛马使唤……但奇怪的是，她却越来越心甘情愿耶!眼看三个月的期限就要到了，既然舍不得他， 她何不把他的心偷来，让他永远典当给她呢？", "base": "files/article/html/34/34446", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2186404.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2186405.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2186406.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2186407.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2186408.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2186409.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2186410.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2186411.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2186412.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2186413.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2186414.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2186415.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2186416.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2186417.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2186418.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2186419.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2186420.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2186421.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2186422.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2186423.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2186424.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2186425.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2186426.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2186427.html", "available": false},